{'symbol': 'CI', 'date': '2022-07-27 16:45:00', 'title': 'CIGNA DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'BLOOMFIELD, CONN. , JULY 27, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF CIGNA CORPORATION (NYSE: CI) TODAY DECLARED A CASH DIVIDEND OF $1.12 PER SHARE OF CIGNA COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE ON\xa0SEPTEMBER 22, 2022 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON\xa0SEPTEMBER 7, 2022.'}